s to fetch periodically (e.g., hourly or manually) rather than push continuously.\n\n7. **Check Battery Health and Usage Stats**\n   - Go into your phone's battery settings to identify specific apps consuming excessive power.\n   - Check the maximum battery capacity/health to determine if the physical battery has degraded and may need replacement.\n\n8. **Keep a Portable Power Bank Handy**\n   - Carry a compact, charged power bank when traveling or during long days out to avoid getting stranded with a depleted battery.","input_tokens":45762,"latency_ms":70662,"output_tokens":477,"question_id":"09d032c9","scored":true,"source_category":"single-session-preference","usd":0.0149211},{"abstained":false,"answer_type":"direct","category":"temporal","claims":[{"claim_id":"clm_39dhczGpgDCBfglwCZTzx","claim_type":"person.fact","object":"Four Roses Distillery","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-28T08:15:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_HtCHG1KMxGYil5vwIiv71","claim_type":"person.fact","object":"book a tour at Four Roses","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-28T08:15:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_Cz5VI4KHtL78vGPWFQ3mE","claim_type":"person.event","object":"Four Roses Distillery","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-28T08:15:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_zMb4X8pgBzJnVg8gaXW4C","claim_type":"person.fact","object":"Anatolia","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-28T00:18:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_sbjl4Vw-Eyd_KL3yoyOu6","claim_type":"person.event","object":"two-week trip to Europe with my parents and younger brother","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-04-01T00:00:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_0zKB5il34UNTbVxW5NGt6","claim_type":"person.fact","object":"Manfrotto BeFree Live","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-28T02:11:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_PISGr7YhSOZBNE1To9w0k","claim_type":"person.fact","object":"Manfrotto MT057CXPRO4 Carbon Fiber Tripod","